-**Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-- **Invalid Depth:** Pixels with $d_k \le 0$ or NaN are excluded from $K$ [S1].
-- **Log Scale:** $RMSE_{log}$ requires $d_k > 0$ and $\hat{d}_k > 0$. If $\hat{d}_k \le 0$, the metric is undefined [S1].
